<title>SINGAPORE: Wing Tai buys more DNP.</title>
<headline>Wing Tai buys more DNP.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wing Tai Holdings said on Tuesday it has acquired one million DNP Holdings Bhd shares for 2.08 million ringgit.</p>
<p>DNP is an associated company of Wing Tai, a statement by Wing Tai said.</p>
<p>Property based Wing Tai said the effective interest in DNP after the acquisition is 45.46 percent or 143.05 million shares. Wing Tai said the acquisition will be paid by using proceeds from its rights issue in 1994. - Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
